  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 73abd5ac62af4a1449db4a5362b7f9d0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OhmsLaw.InteractionGate
  m_Time: 29.125000166893006
  gateId: S11_Target
  description: "Make the ammeter read 0.60 A with the battery slider (bottom-left,
    created and removed by the gate) or Ask Wattson. The strip shows V, I and the
    target; the 'now' ring and its ghost move on the graph. A held miss: '\u25B2
    more volts' / '\u25BC fewer volts' and S11_Target_H (once; 15 s idle also); 2nd
    miss: Wattson sets 3 V with S11_Target_X while point 3 lights. Hit: S11_Target_OK.
    Confident(Graph) after a first-time hit: bonus 0.80 A (S11_Target_GO2 / _X2 /
    _OK2). autoAnswer sets the target."
  lines:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0c29b9f59db74ab41a907021895ef10c, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 33f8c01c2c8e62e428d5d5da3e0558f7, type: 2}
